# Training Quotes Folder

Place your historical quotes here for RAG training.

## File Format
Use markdown (.md) files with this structure:
- Client Information
- Initial Requirements
- Communication History (back-and-forth)
- Final Requirements Summary
- Final Quote (with hour breakdown)
- Assumptions & Exclusions
- Outcome (if available)

See /specs/rag-implementation-strategy.md for detailed examples.
